<!-- ═══ PRICING CTA STRIP ═══ -->
<section class="pricing-cta-strip" data-screen-label="03 CTA strip">
  <div class="container">
    <h2>
      <span data-lang-es>Pruébalo <em>30 días sin costo.</em></span>
      <span data-lang-en>Try it <em>30 days free.</em></span>
    </h2>
    <p>
      <span data-lang-es>Crea tu cuenta gratis y desbloquea Premium por un mes completo. Sin tarjeta. Sin compromisos. Si no es para ti, sigues gratis para siempre.</span>
      <span data-lang-en>Create your free account and unlock Premium for a full month. No card. No commitment. If it's not for you, you stay free forever.</span>
    </p>
    <div class="btn-row">
      <a class="btn btn--white" href="<%= free_cta_path %>">
        <span data-lang-es><%= free_cta_es %></span><span data-lang-en><%= free_cta_en %></span>
        <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"/></svg>
      </a>
      <% if @subscription_state == :premium %>
        <a class="btn btn--outline-light" href="<%= portal_subscription_path %>"><span data-lang-es>Administrar suscripción</span><span data-lang-en>Manage subscription</span></a>
      <% elsif @subscription_state.in?([:on_trial, :expired]) %>
        <%= form_tag(checkout_subscription_path, method: :post) do %>
          <input type="hidden" name="plan" value="premium">
          <button type="submit" class="btn btn--outline-light" style="cursor:pointer; border:2px solid rgba(255,255,255,.6);"><span data-lang-es>Activar Premium</span><span data-lang-en>Activate Premium</span></button>
        <% end %>
      <% else %>
        <a class="btn btn--outline-light" href="<%= new_user_path %>"><span data-lang-es>Suscribirme a Premium</span><span data-lang-en>Subscribe to Premium</span></a>
      <% end %>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ═══ FAQ ═══ -->
<section class="faq pricing-faq" id="faq" data-screen-label="04 Pricing FAQ">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head">
      <div class="section-eyebrow reveal"><span class="tag">FAQ</span></div>
      <h2 class="section-title reveal d1">
        <span data-lang-es>Sobre <em>los precios.</em></span>
        <span data-lang-en>About <em>pricing.</em></span>
      </h2>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-list reveal d1">
      <details class="faq-item"><summary class="faq-q"><span data-lang-es>¿Necesito poner tarjeta para registrarme?</span><span data-lang-en>Do I need to enter a card to sign up?</span><span class="faq-icon"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round"><line x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19"/><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/></svg></span></summary><div class="faq-a"><span data-lang-es>No. Te registras gratis con email y contraseña. La tarjeta solo se pide cuando decides activar Premium pagado al terminar tu prueba.</span><span data-lang-en>No. You sign up free with email and password. We only ask for a card when you decide to activate paid Premium after your trial ends.</span></div></details>

      <details class="faq-item"><summary class="faq-q"><span data-lang-es>¿Qué pasa al terminar los 30 días de Premium?</span><span data-lang-en>What happens after the 30-day Premium trial?</span><span class="faq-icon"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round"><line x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19"/><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/></svg></span></summary><div class="faq-a"><span data-lang-es>Tu cuenta pasa automáticamente al plan Gratis. No te cobramos nada. Tus datos no se pierden — solo se desactivan las funciones Premium. Puedes reactivar Premium cuando quieras.</span><span data-lang-en>Your account automatically switches to the Free plan. We don't charge you. Your data isn't lost — only Premium features are turned off. You can re-activate Premium anytime.</span></div></details>

      <details class="faq-item"><summary class="faq-q"><span data-lang-es>¿Puedo cambiar entre mensual y anual?</span><span data-lang-en>Can I switch between monthly and annual?</span><span class="faq-icon"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round"><line x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19"/><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/></svg></span></summary><div class="faq-a"><span data-lang-es>Sí, cuando quieras. Si pasas de mensual a anual prorrateamos el saldo. Si vas al revés, esperamos al final de tu ciclo anual.</span><span data-lang-en>Yes, anytime. Switching monthly to annual prorates your balance. Going the other way waits until your annual cycle ends.</span></div></details>

      <details class="faq-item"><summary class="faq-q"><span data-lang-es>¿Cómo cancelo?</span><span data-lang-en>How do I cancel?</span><span class="faq-icon"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round"><line x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19"/><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/></svg></span></summary><div class="faq-a"><span data-lang-es>Desde Ajustes → Suscripción → Cancelar. Un clic. Tu plan Premium sigue activo hasta el final del ciclo que ya pagaste y luego pasa a Gratis.</span><span data-lang-en>From Settings → Subscription → Cancel. One click. Your Premium stays active until the end of the cycle you paid for and then switches to Free.</span></div></details>

      <details class="faq-item"><summary class="faq-q"><span data-lang-es>¿Qué métodos de pago aceptan?</span><span data-lang-en>What payment methods do you accept?</span><span class="faq-icon"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round"><line x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19"/><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/></svg></span></summary><div class="faq-a"><span data-lang-es>Procesamos pagos con Stripe. Aceptamos las principales tarjetas de crédito y débito emitidas en México — Visa, Mastercard y American Express.</span><span data-lang-en>We process payments with Stripe. We accept major credit and debit cards issued in Mexico — Visa, Mastercard and American Express.</span></div></details>

      <details class="faq-item"><summary class="faq-q"><span data-lang-es>¿Me dan factura?</span><span data-lang-en>Do you issue invoices?</span><span class="faq-icon"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round"><line x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19"/><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/></svg></span></summary><div class="faq-a"><span data-lang-es>Por ahora no emitimos CFDI directamente. Recibes un comprobante de pago de Stripe que puedes usar para tu contabilidad. Estamos trabajando en facturación CFDI 4.0 directa — escríbenos a <a href="mailto:hola@vitt.io" style="color:var(--indigo-600); font-weight:600;">hola@vitt.io</a> si la necesitas.</span><span data-lang-en>We don't issue CFDI invoices directly yet. You receive a Stripe payment receipt you can use for accounting. Direct CFDI 4.0 invoicing is on the roadmap — email <a href="mailto:hola@vitt.io" style="color:var(--indigo-600); font-weight:600;">hola@vitt.io</a> if you need it.</span></div></details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

